  "createdAt": "2026-10-12T10:23:37.190728Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-12T10:37:04.111351Z",
  "totalBlocks": 30,
  "translatedBlocks": 30,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dacc078a47480265",
      "translationZh": "我想最终确定自己日常使用的主力模型，但还不清楚该选哪一个。我有一张 5060ti 16GB 显卡，所以挑选了以下几个候选模型，它们在我的硬件上运行速度似乎都还不错：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1df58337999ac4ea",
      "translationZh": "在 Strata 下运行的 Swift 1.5 IQ2_XS GSQ-RCO",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f7d9184d54353031",
      "translationZh": "在 Strata 下运行的 Flash Next IQ3_S GSQ-RCO",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a3829b30a445d649",
      "translationZh": "在 llama.cpp 下运行的 27B IQS_3 GSQ-RCO",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09cbd33b2a6666f9",
      "translationZh": "我还想了解思考强度如何影响模型表现，所以也把全部 4 个可用的思考强度档位（none、low、medium、xhigh）纳入了这次遍历测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8de7ec20e5d63766",
      "translationZh": "最后，我用 AtCoder 的题目作为测试数据，并以 LiveCodeBench 为基础搭建测试框架，做出了自己的小型基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e1b1c5ec36b35eb",
      "translationZh": "我只挑选了过去 30 天内的题目作为测试集，以确保模型在训练中没有见过这些题目。最终，测试集包含了 14 道难度各异的题目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db83fba2e3b6fc47",
      "translationZh": "所有测试都将思考预算上限设为 32k tokens。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89bec9349b09cf09",
      "translationZh": "硬件：AMD 7945HX CPU、64GB DDR5 5200 内存和 5060ti 16GB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5851e6815ecb2045",
      "translationZh": "软件：操作系统 - Arch Linux。llama.cpp：构建版本 11149，140k 上下文，Strata - 0.1.38，128k 上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15fa73c4b1d472e9",
      "translationZh": "运行所有测试花了将近 11 小时。CAP+DNF burn 是花在未解决问题上的时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20fa5a64f586b475",
      "translationZh": "以下是汇总表：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0587b97c532b95a0",
      "translationZh": "problem - AtCoder 上的问题 id",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b36cf0f139285542",
      "translationZh": "pts - atcoder 为每道题给出的难度分值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "414bdc0f1a726e7f",
      "translationZh": "low、med、xhi、non - 推理投入等级",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0414cac67316a8bf",
      "translationZh": "CAP - 模型达到了 32K 思考上限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2028de140ffdd553",
      "translationZh": "DNF - 未生成代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a32d8d13508d8bfb",
      "translationZh": "ERR - 已生成代码，但未返回预期结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9089665b6c21ec2a",
      "translationZh": "其余单元格显示返回预期结果时的模型运行时间，单位为秒",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3791a7980234aee5",
      "translationZh": "在这个基准测试中，思考并没有带来多少收益。三个模型的最高成绩与各自在 low 档的得分相差都在 ±2 道题以内，而且没有任何模型的成绩随着 low → med → xhi 单调提升。Flash 在 med 档达到峰值（11），Swift 在 xhi 档达到峰值（10），但在 med 档出现了 3 个 ERR，27b 则在所有档位都保持为 10。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39ed86b936a16ada",
      "translationZh": "不投入思考是唯一会稳定导致表现下降的设置——而且下降的方式很具体：DNF 只出现在 none 档（共 4 个，全部来自 flash/swift），同时 ERR 数量骤增（27b 0→2，flash 0→2，swift 0→4）。没有思考通道时，模型要么跳过代码围栏，要么写出错误的代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "045717ad57967bbf",
      "translationZh": "提高思考投入主要换来的是触及 CAP 上限，而不是解出题目。Flash 的 CAP 数量为 4→3→5，Swift 为 3→3→4，27b 为 3→4→4，而从 low 到 xhi，耗时增加了 33–57%。额外的思考 token 都花在了模型本来就会失败的题目上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed16e027cabbe852",
      "translationZh": "Swift 很快，但不够严谨；如果速度比准确性更重要，我可能会用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49ff0dc789977082",
      "translationZh": "27B 很可靠，但非常慢。Flash 能解出更多题目，速度也更快，所以我看不出使用 27B 的理由。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b271f6fec1754a8b",
      "translationZh": "Flash IQ3_S 在速度和准确性之间似乎取得了很好的折中。此外，在 medium 思考强度下，它比 27B 多解决了一道题。我在日常使用中也注意到，采用 Q3 量化的 Flash 似乎比 27B 更聪明，有时还会给出 27B 未能发现的见解。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c62bd024708ccff2",
      "translationZh": "在思考强度方面，我会继续使用 medium，如果 medium 卡住了，就切换到 xhigh。我也可能尝试在处理简单任务时关闭思考。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "efb2c71328839e8c",
      "translationZh": "我确实理解这次测试的局限性——数据点并不多，而且模型行为也存在一定的随机性，因此这些数字应谨慎看待。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a480506296a439da",
      "translationZh": "我可能会继续进行这项测试，将范围缩小到更复杂的问题，并使用高得多的思考预算，看看会发生什么。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afc5e02477c1325e",
      "translationZh": "请告诉我你的看法，并分享你自己的观察。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06b6c1da68ac6e25",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/ColorsOfCosmos 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
